# Trickster's Stratagem: the owner chooses the bottom this time: Bot2's library is Swamp, Mountain, Forest, Ornithopter. Bot2's
# creature is the first target and a creature of Bot1's is the optional second (the cast asks for them in order). Bot1's
# Ornithopter connives, but Bot1 discards the Island it drew with the Lightning Bolt in hand: a land discarded means no +1/+1
# counter (CR 701.50a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Trickster's Stratagem
Island x3
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x6
Plains
Swamp
Mountain
Forest

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Trickster's Stratagem.Cast
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
